%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': {'fontSize':'15px'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant Git as bam-masterdata (git)
    participant EX as explorer
    participant RE as extractor
    participant GA as gap-analyzer
    actor Reviewer
    participant MX as masterdata-extender
    participant NB as notebook-generator
    participant PA as parser-generator

    Operator->>Git: /bam-sync
    Git-->>Operator: commit SHA (standard refreshed)

    Operator->>EX: /bam-analyze-prd <prd>
    EX-->>Operator: CATALOG.md (what exists)
    Operator->>RE: (same command, step 2)
    RE-->>Operator: requirements.json (what PRD needs)
    Operator->>GA: (same command, step 3)
    GA-->>Operator: gap-report.md (REUSE / EXTEND / CREATE)

    Note over Operator,Reviewer: ⏸ HUMAN REVIEW CHECKPOINT ⏸
    Reviewer->>Reviewer: verify citations & verdicts
    Reviewer-->>Operator: approved ✔

    par Generate deliverables
        Operator->>MX: /bam-generate-types
        MX-->>Operator: datamodel/*.py (CREATE only)
    and
        Operator->>NB: /bam-generate-notebook
        NB-->>Operator: *_provisioning.ipynb (14 cells)
    and
        Operator->>PA: /bam-generate-parser
        PA-->>Operator: parsers/ package
    end
